  "scene_rows": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "温网第一轮，谢尔顿拿到赛点，最后却输掉了比赛。两个多月后，他第一次站上大满贯决赛的球场。",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:d9fd7379db856a3eeb7e4d584d49b41a2445d4f41b5284b3108de8ed98dca5b5"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "not_required_by_audio_identity_alone"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "先从澳网说起。打进8强之后，他三盘输给辛纳。",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:8588f839671a7449712da6bf395f62813950b3deb0b0670781bb1b5c2b0e19e2"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "not_required_by_audio_identity_alone"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "二月达拉斯，面对弗里茨，他在决胜盘救回三个冠军点，最后逆转夺冠。",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:1dad5b79b639856b1e7e95578237e8995a9d2b2862222a7d7856a745069c3f39"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "not_required_by_audio_identity_alone"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "四月慕尼黑，两盘击败科博利，赛季第二冠到手。这一回，他在红土上举起奖杯。",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:5d28abe81edfb1f825351f28225e40992ac3b32da93482d1029ebf88bd55f39e"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "not_required_by_audio_identity_alone"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "可到了法网，他却在第二轮三盘输给科利尼翁。红土冠军，没有变成大满贯突破。",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:6f1396e11152c839721e6caf3e42bc062030a7c15beed8199b90c7de0dd56791"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "not_required_by_audio_identity_alone"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "转上草地，斯图加特决赛又遇弗里茨。他三盘赢球，拿到生涯第一座草地冠军。",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:bbb9abe520901d57acab8a10f0c7ca0673a2a48d330b3e73ec70a05c545d835f"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "not_required_by_audio_identity_alone"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "半个月后的温网，决胜盘最后的抢十，他曾以八比五领先，还拿到一个赛点，最终却在第一轮出局。",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:b6ed6c850367b8715719584d8bfab5a2b5adb84702b75f6572a45244bd78902a"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "not_required_by_audio_identity_alone"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "八月，加拿大大师赛。他六场比赛一盘未失，两盘击败中岛布兰登，成功卫冕。",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:86aea89485d44329c31e403718c56a899aa22f7715a13808d6b50ecb91980f5b"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "not_required_by_audio_identity_alone"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "美网，他第一次击败阿尔卡拉斯，又逆转蒂亚福，第一次打进大满贯决赛。",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:cb1a2ae99af4294b5e7ed202686b1284554919b9c1bd1d58128e49513f75922e"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "not_required_by_audio_identity_alone"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "决赛对兹维列夫，他四盘落败，收获亚军。从温网首轮到纽约决赛，他走出了完全不同的一段路。",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:23935a43ed121de905e2e1e106270b1bd13951805d9ca31a20c38506a2cff6bf"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "not_required_by_audio_identity_alone"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "亚洲赛季，上海止步第三轮。十月十八日，另一场比赛替他锁定了年终席位。",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:65e9d340da27d6cd9f1df6b4c54443d436f2d6fcdc748fec67111a2dc969631e"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "not_required_by_audio_identity_alone"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "达维多维奇·福基纳，在上海决赛击败霍达尔。谢尔顿连续第二年，拿到都灵门票。",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:29bf7848a24237c030f4ee45d5f36c63db59e5d0a83914c6fa789350d9a42a4e"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "not_required_by_audio_identity_alone"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "资格到手以后，巴塞尔止步第二轮。巴黎先胜诺里，再逆转林德克内希，打进8强。",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:a703e7bd26d815ecea1572936fc2d19d4137584a5251b4ac4ceafe12531a3219"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "required_latest_results"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "截至十一月六日，谢尔顿四千七百二十分，排名赛季积分榜第四。高亮的六位球员，都已锁定年终资格。",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:87e3cd1d840c05a614320a459ec1d107e49cf5f5a2f149bd2fdd7dd93e531bcb"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "required_latest_race"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "错过温网赛点，后来站上美网决赛。第二次到都灵，你看好谢尔顿冲进4强吗？",
      "request_ids": [
        "bundle:be3fea002cc3e1ea250333695e79dad44a0452a2a0de4b06f2e903bf196e7193"
      ],
      "minimum_revision": "not_required_by_audio_identity_alone"
    }
